/*  the side panel of the table of contents (screen-only): a fixed
    full-height drawer at the left viewport edge, carrying a replica of
    the brand bar on its right edge, which exactly covers the brand bar
    of the page while the panel is slid in, so the panel appears to sit
    left of the brand bar and to shift it aside when slid out, with its
    tab (a menu icon drawn like the search icon, as none of the bundled
    fonts carries the U+2630 glyph, and sized like the search tab)
    riding right of the bar below the folding tab  */
nav.toc-panel
    position: fixed
    top: 0
    bottom: 0
    left: 0
    width: 31rem
    z-index: 20
    transform: translateX(calc(-100% + 0.6rem))
    transition: transform 0.3s ease
